PATENT APPLICATION TITLE:
"System and Method for AI-Powered Interpretation of Aviation Regulatory Requirements"

INVENTOR(S): [TO BE COMPLETED]
FILING DATE: [TO BE COMPLETED]
APPLICATION TYPE: Utility Patent
TECHNOLOGY FIELD: Artificial Intelligence / Natural Language Processing / Aviation Regulatory Technology

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

ABSTRACT

A computer-implemented system and method for artificial intelligence-powered interpretation of aviation regulatory requirements, comprising: a natural language processing engine that analyzes regulatory text to extract semantic meaning and intent; a contextual interpretation module that considers operational scenarios and organizational factors; an ambiguity resolution algorithm that identifies unclear regulatory language and provides clarification recommendations; and a compliance guidance generator that translates regulatory requirements into actionable implementation steps. The system enables automated interpretation of complex regulatory language while maintaining accuracy and consistency across different operational contexts and jurisdictions.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

BACKGROUND OF THE INVENTION

Field of the Invention
This invention relates to artificial intelligence systems for regulatory compliance, and more particularly to systems and methods for automated interpretation of aviation regulatory requirements using natural language processing and machine learning technologies.

Description of Related Art
Aviation regulatory documents contain complex legal and technical language that requires expert interpretation for practical implementation. Current challenges include:

1. Ambiguous regulatory language requiring expert legal and technical interpretation
2. Context-dependent requirements that vary based on operational scenarios
3. Inconsistent interpretation across organizations and jurisdictions
4. High costs for regulatory compliance consulting and legal expertise
5. Time-consuming manual analysis of regulatory requirements for implementation

Existing systems provide basic regulatory text search and retrieval but lack sophisticated interpretation capabilities. No current solution offers automated analysis of regulatory intent, context-aware interpretation, or systematic ambiguity resolution for aviation compliance requirements.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

SUMMARY OF THE INVENTION

The present invention provides a comprehensive AI-powered system for interpreting aviation regulatory requirements that transforms complex regulatory language into clear, actionable compliance guidance.

Primary Objectives:
1. Automate interpretation of complex regulatory language using AI and NLP
2. Provide context-aware interpretation based on operational scenarios
3. Identify and resolve ambiguities in regulatory requirements
4. Generate actionable compliance guidance from regulatory text
5. Ensure consistent interpretation across organizations and jurisdictions

Key Technical Innovations:
- Advanced natural language processing for regulatory text analysis
- Context-aware interpretation algorithms considering operational factors
- Systematic ambiguity detection and resolution protocols
- Machine learning models trained on regulatory interpretation patterns
- Automated generation of implementation-ready compliance guidance

