TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS

Performance Requirements:
- Regulatory text processing speed: 1000 words per second
- Interpretation accuracy: >92% for standard regulatory language
- Ambiguity detection recall: >95% for known ambiguity patterns
- Context adaptation time: <10 seconds for organizational profiles
- System response time: <5 seconds for interpretation queries

AI Model Specifications:
- Training data corpus: 10M+ words of aviation regulatory text
- Model architecture: Transformer-based with domain-specific fine-tuning
- Language support: English, with extensibility for French, Spanish, German
- Continuous learning capability: Real-time model updates from expert feedback
- Interpretation confidence scoring: Probabilistic confidence intervals

Scalability and Integration:
- Concurrent interpretation requests: 1000+ simultaneous users
- Regulatory corpus size: 100MB+ of regulatory text per jurisdiction
- API response capacity: 10,000+ interpretation requests per minute
- Integration compatibility: REST APIs, webhook notifications, batch processing
- Cloud deployment: Multi-region availability with 99.9% uptime

